    "alert_id": "ALERT_004",
    "title": "No clinician assessment or plan documented",
    "message": "No clinician assessment or plan was documented for this visit. The patient is a pregnant woman on ART for 10 weeks with rising creatinine, a DTG-iron supplement interaction to manage, and specific VL monitoring requirements in pregnancy. Guidelines require structured follow-up including VL monitoring at delivery and ongoing renal monitoring on TDF. The absence of a documented plan risks gaps in managing these issues. Weight gain of 6 kg (62 to 68 kg) since pre-pregnancy may reflect normal pregnancy progression but should be assessed alongside DTG-associated weight gain.",
    "issue_type": "plan_review",
